sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant E as Envoy
    participant L as Lyft Ratelimit
    participant R as Redis
    participant M as AI Model

    U->>E: POST /v1/chat/completions
    E->>L: Is x-api-key-id + model over limit?
    L->>R: INCR rpm-rule/0/abc123/deepseek-r1
    R-->>L: Returns Count (e.g. 43)
    
    alt Under Limit (e.g., limit is 60)
        L-->>E: Allow (OK)
        E->>M: Forward Request
        M-->>U: AI Response
    else Over Limit (e.g., hits 61)
        L-->>E: Deny (OverLimit)
        E-->>U: 429 Too Many Requests
    end
